{"sourceUrl":"https://me.gxu.edu.cn/info/1002/5297.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:50.550813+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://me.gxu.edu.cn/info/1002/5297.htm","html":"<div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>为完善和规范推荐免试研究生（以下简称：推免生）复试工作，提高我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>研究生生源质量，根据教育部</span></span><span><span>相关</span></span><span><span>文件</span></span><span><span>及学校的通知精神，</span></span><span><span>结合我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>实际情况，</span></span><span><span>制定</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年推免生复试工作方案如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>组织管理</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>充分认识到推免生复试工作的重要性，认真做好推免生的复试工作。</span></span><strong><span><span><span>经学院</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>研究生招生复试录取工作领导小组讨论决定，</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>成立</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>学</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>院推免生复试工作领导小组和</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>推免生</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>复试</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>工作</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>小组</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>（以下简称推免生领导小组和推免生工作小组）。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生领导小组</span></span><span><span>由</span></span><span><span>学院研究生招生复试录取工作领导小组组长</span></span><span><span>担任组长</span></span><span><span>，推免生工作小组由</span></span><span>3<span>位</span></span><span><span>及以上</span></span><span><span>责任心强、教学经验丰富、外语水平较高并具有副高职称以上的教师担任。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>工作</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>职责</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）推免生</span></span><span><span>领导小组</span></span><span><span>要认真学习教育部、自治区招考院关于推免工作的相关文件并落实到位，</span></span><span><span>加强</span></span><span><span>对</span></span><span><span>推免生复试工作的领导、组织、协调和管理；</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>领导小组应对复试</span></span><span><span>工作</span></span><span><span>小组的成员进行必要的培训，确保复试严格按照既定方案和程序进行，充分体现复试的公平、公正，保证复试质量</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）推免生工作</span></span><span><span>小组根据相关通知要求，在规定的</span></span><span><span>接收阶段</span></span><span><span>时间内，</span></span><span><span>通过</span><span>“推免服务系统”遴选推免生，发放</span></span><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>待录取通知；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生工作</span></span><span><span>小组根据推免生复试情况，公正、公平、科学、合理地给推免生评分，</span></span><span><span>复试结果</span></span><strong><span><span><span>在学院网站、学院橱窗公告栏</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>公示</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>（含姓名、复试成绩等，可按复试的不同批次分批分次公示），公示期间公示内容不得修改，如有变动，须对变动部分做出说明，并对变动内容另行公示</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）学</span></span><span><span>院推免生领导小组加强对推免生复试工作的领导和监督；考生对复试提出质疑时，</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>领导小组</span></span><span><span>及推免生工作小组</span></span><span><span>应提供书面说明，负责向考生进行解释或提出解决的办法。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>为</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>保证推免过程和结果的公平公正，</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>学院推免生</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>领导小组、工作小组</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>及</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>相关</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>工作</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>人员有直系亲属或利益相关人员</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>报名参加</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>本学院推免招生的应主动申请回避，</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>有</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>非直系亲属等报名参加推免招生的</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>要向</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>学院、研究生院主动报备。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<center>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>序号</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>学位层次</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>学位类型</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业代码</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业名称</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>拟接收推免生人数</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>博士（直博生）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>学术型</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>80200</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>机械工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>0</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>硕士</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>学术型</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>80200</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>机械工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>0</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业型</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>85500</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>机械</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>0</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业型</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>85802</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>动力工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>10</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</center>\n<p><span><span>考生被录取后必须全脱产学习，学生档案和工资关系全部转入我校（我校不录取培养方式为定向的直博生）。直博生学制</span></span><span>5<span>年，不做硕士学位论文，不参加硕士答辩；</span></span><span><span>直博生录取后享受博士生待遇（非定向生免缴学费）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>四、选拔条件</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（直博生原则上综合成绩排名在年级前</span></span><span>10%</span><span><span>）；</span></span><span><span>直博生须提前与意向博士生导师沟通，且导师具备当年直博招生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强创新意识和创新能力及牢固的专业基础知识。具有被推荐高校认定有特殊学术专长的，可优先考虑；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>诚实守信、学风端正、不存在任何违反学术道德和专业伦理的行为，以及在本科学习期间未受过任何行政处罚或处分；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span><span>身心健康，符合教育部和我校规定的体检合格标准</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span><span>预计能够按时取得本科毕业证书、学士学位证书。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、推荐免试研究生申请材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请广西大学</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span><span>年推荐免试生的学生，需提供以下申请材料：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）学生证、身份证复印件各一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）国家级外语考试成绩或合格证书复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）加盖所在学校教务部门公章的本科学习成绩单一份（原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）有公开发表的学术论文、科研成果或获奖证书者，需提供复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）二级甲等以上医院的体检表</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>）政审表（可</span></span><span><span>在我校研究生院网站下载</span></span><span><span>专区</span></span><span><span>下载</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（七）《广西大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表》（可</span></span><span><span>在我校研究生院网站下载</span></span><span><span>专区</span></span><span><span>下载</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>八</span></span><span><span>）直博生须额外提交《广西大学博士研究生学业研修规划报告》，《学业研修规划报告》内容应体现个人对研究生阶段学习的目标、课题研究的思考和准备、研究生阶段预期取得的学术成果等内容，考生的《学业研修规划报告》需本人签字，签字扫描件于规定时间前发送至邮箱</span></span><span>xdjx3234980@163.com</span><span><span>（命名方式：姓名</span><span>-</span><span>报考博导姓名</span><span>-</span><span>学业研修规划报告）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>材料整理及提交方式：所提供材料均采用</span></span><span>A4</span><span><span>纸大小（成绩单可按所在学校格式），申请材料均需在</span></span><strong><span><span>复试前</span></span></strong><span><span>递交到学院研究生办公室（地址：机械学院三楼</span><span>3</span></span><span>19</span><span><span>），一经收到，不再退还（校外考生请提供电子版，在复试前发送至</span></span><span>xdjx3234980@163.com</span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、复试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>内容及方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）学院将在</span><span>“推免服务系统”（</span></span><span><span>网</span></span><span><span>址：</span></span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>中筛选、接收各校推免生。具体复试时间及复试批次根据申请情况在该阶段时间内另定，会直接通知申请者本人。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>采用综合面试的</span></span><span><span>方式进行</span></span><span><span>，综合根据申请者的学习所在地选择</span></span><strong><span><span>线下</span></span></strong><span><span>或</span></span><strong><span><span>线上</span></span></strong><span><span>方式进行，具体方式将在复试通知中明确。考核时间不少于</span></span><span>10</span><span><span>分钟（直博生不少于</span><span>20</span><span>分钟），</span></span><span><span>综合</span></span><span><span>面试成绩即复试</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>综合面试</span></span><span><span>成绩满分为</span><span>1</span></span><span>00</span><span><span>分，</span></span><span><span>重点考察</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>生所掌握的知识结构、外语水平</span></span><span><span>且注重一贯表现，强化对学生科研创新潜质和专业能力倾向的考核，</span></span><span><span>严格审核认定学生的特殊学术专长</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>综合</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>内容及权重为：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>基础考察（政治思想、身心健康及表达），占</span><span>20%</span><span>，即满分</span><span>2</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>分；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>外语（含口语、听力），占</span><span>20%</span><span>，即满分</span><span>2</span></span><span>0<span>分</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>成绩和科研，占</span></span><span>55</span><span><span>%</span><span>，即满分</span></span><span>55<span>分</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span><span>特殊</span></span><span><span>学术专长</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>占</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>%</span><span><span>，即满分</span></span><span>5<span>分</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>特殊</span></span><span><span>学术专长</span></span><span><span>原则上仅限</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>生</span></span><span><span>本科阶段在核心期刊上以独立</span></span><span><span>作者</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span>第一</span></span><span><span>作者发表的与学业相关的科研论文</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>作为主力成员参加与学业相关的国内权威科研</span></span><span><span>竞赛</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>全国</span></span><span><span>赛）</span></span><span><span>并获得</span></span><span><span>三等奖以上奖励（</span></span><span><span>国际</span></span><span><span>赛事参照执行</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>但不得低于国内赛事相关要求）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>学生</span></span><span><span>与</span></span><span><span>直系</span></span><span><span>亲属</span></span><span><span>或学历</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>职称、职务明显高于本人者合作的科研成果、竞赛奖项等仅作为</span></span><span><span>参考</span></span><span><span>，不纳入学生本人</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>遴选综合评价成绩计算</span></span><span><span>体系，</span></span><span><span>同等条件下可优先考虑。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>综合面试过程要全程录音、录像，学院保管三年。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>入学前发现推免生提交不实材料而影响录取结果的，不予录取。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）学院会及时在推免服务系统内给待录取的推免生发待录取通知。</span><span>考生收到待录取通知后，须在</span><span>24</span><span>小时内通过“推免服务系统”中及时确认录取，否则视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、拟录取</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>标准</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>推免硕士研究生复试总成绩需达到</span><span>60</span><span>分以上（含</span><span>60</span><span>分）。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>推免直博生复试总成绩需达到</span><span>70</span><span>分以上（含</span><span>70</span><span>分）。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>已被我校接收的推免生，不得再报名参加</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、资格复核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学校将于发放录取通知书前对同意接受且履行正式报名手续的推免生进行资格复核。复核通过的予以发放录取通知书。复核未通过的，取消录取资格。复核内容包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>完成本科培养方案应修学分及各培养环节，预期在我校新生入学前取得本科毕业证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>最后一学年未受到任何处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>九、其他说明</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1.</span><span>申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，一经发现申请人提交的材料内容不真实或不准确，将根据情况，可予取消申请人录取资格。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span><span>.</span><span>直博生录取专业及导师在报名时一经确定，后期不予更改。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>3.</span><span>咨询及申诉联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>办公时间为周一至周五上午</span><span>7:50--12:00</span><span>，下午</span><span>2:40--5:30</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0771-3234980</span><span>；</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span></span><span><span>975159374</span></span><span><span>（加群原因请备注：推免拟报考专业</span><span>-</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>本校学校名称）；</span><span>E-mail</span><span>：</span><span>xdjx3234980@163.com</span><span>，</span></span><span><span>梁</span></span><span><span>老师、</span></span><span><span>李</span></span><span><span>老师。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>机械工程学院     </span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日    </span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>一审一校：莫  帅</span></p>\n<p><span>二审二<span>校</span>：陈宏波</span></p>\n<p><span>三审三<span>校</span>：郑雪明</span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"043f4ea8daeceb59c9606658336bfea0e1ea7d8f0becfc9d28dad25046d09076","textLength":2988,"sourceSha256":"6efb99e571a36a6a2fa2c8e851202736c3fdb6ee0e7c9de3616453d2362bc2ca","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2320b3c43b930b5121fe","title":"2026年广西大学机械工程学院2027年招收推荐免试研究生复试工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:50.550813+00:00"}
